        bullets: [
          `The official /tutorial: Figma → MCP → token-exact code in 4 steps`,
          `Participants prompt Claude in the cohort's framework along exactly that guide: compose a ${TARGET.name} from ${TARGET.parts} — no change to an existing component API, but composition from existing building blocks`,
