          "The skills participants have: `atelier-component` (the workspace's own skill — it is the design-to-code loop for your workspace and carries the rest of the day from Block 02 on), `uianatomy-mcp` (present in every workspace, triggers automatically here), `figma-workspace-architect` (only in workspaces generated with Figma; accompanies Block 01), and the four Storybook skills",
        ],
