          'Participant skills are exactly the ones the scaffold installs: `atelier-component`, `uianatomy-mcp`, `figma-workspace-architect` (Figma workspaces only) and the four Storybook skills. `design-to-code`, `atelier-design` and `artboard-bridge` are repo/trainer-only; they appear only in the appendix.',
        ],
